pt-PT.txt.gz is made from the European Portuguese Hunspell dictionary, as
LibreOffice ships it (https://github.com/LibreOffice/dictionaries, pt_PT).
Bandmate uses it under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1
(https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/lgpl-2.1.html), one of the
licences its authors offer it under. Section 3 of that licence lets it be
used under the GNU General Public License instead, which is why it can
ship in Bandmate, under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3.
Their notices follow.

